{"sections":[{"slug":"BGG定理","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"BGG定理"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“BGG <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“BGG 定理”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#<span lang=\"zh\">几何表示论</span></p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\mathfrak h^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的偏序</span> $\\leq_\\subset$: <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $\\lambda ,\\mu \\in\\mathfrak h^*$, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span>\n$$\r\n\\mu\\leq s_{\\alpha_1}\\cdot \\mu \\leq s_{\\alpha_2}s_{\\alpha_1}\\cdot \\mu\\leq\\cdots\\leq \\lambda,\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $s_\\alpha$ <span lang=\"zh\">是关于正</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/根","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">根</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\alpha$) <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $\\mu\\leq_\\subset \\lambda$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $M_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">为最高权</span> $\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Verma模","text":"Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":", $L_\\mu$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $M_\\mu$ <span lang=\"zh\">的唯一不可约商</span>.</p>\n<p>BGG <span lang=\"zh\">定理是说</span>, (<span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $M_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Jordan–Holder分解","text":"Jordan–Holder <span lang=\"zh\">分解</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>) $[M_\\lambda : L_\\mu]\\neq 0$ <span lang=\"zh\">当且仅当</span> $\\mu\\leq_{\\subset} \\lambda$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}